  "title": "dumpcap: Add a comment about capabilities and monitor mode",
  "description": "On Linux, if we capture on an mac80211 device and enable monitor mode\n(which requires that libpcap is built with libnl support), that creates\na virtual device on the same wiphy that libpcap tries to delete when\ncapturing is done. Dropping privileges means that will fail with EPERM,\nleaving the device hanging around to be deleted manually. (Or possibly\nby something like NetworkManager.)\n\n[skip ci]",
